BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Black holes: tides (the trailer shot)</h1>
A delta-glider lowered nose-first towards a black hole of 600 solar masses (spin 0.8, a faint disc), the damage model on, by script
(Script/Tests/TrailerTides): heard from its cockpit as the tides build - creaks, groans,
its parts tearing off - then seen from outside as it breaks up and falls in, in slow motion.
END_HYPERDESC

